@coderabbitai Addressed in 3d63038a1. `.agents/tools/wordpress/wp-dev.md:158` now describes exclusions using `exclude_from_search => true` and explicitly notes that `inherit` records (including attachments) can be returned by `'any'`. Other status caveats and guard recommendations are preserved.

Verified against WordPress 6.8 `wp-includes/post.php:737-744` and `wp-includes/class-wp-query.php:2655-2659`. `git diff --check`, pre-commit checks, and push-hook typecheck passed; the fix is pushed.

